        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>SOSS 218IC Invisible Spring Closer Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n The Self-Closing Invisible Hinge is the perfect solution to modern spaces where a clean look is desired. Once installed, this Invisible Spring Closer Hinge cannot be seen when the door is closed. A self-closing hinge, it works much like any spring hinge, it returns the door to the closed position by itself. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation. For use on on 1-3/4 inch thick wood doors, please use one hinge for every 75 lbs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-PBPC.jpg?v=1704442279\" width=\"364\" height=\"216\" border=\"0\" alt=\"SOSS 218ic Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Invisible Hinge Spring Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Opens a complete 180 degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Allow one (1) hinge for every 75 lbs of door weight.</li>\r\n<li>Tension is adjustable by using an allen wrench while the hinge is installed.</li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SOSS 218IC Invisible Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Body Width: 1-41/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Body Backplate Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Minimum 1-3/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: High Strength Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SOSS-218ic-specifications.pdf?v=1704262321\" target=\"new\"><b>SOSS 218IC Hinge Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually (1 Door Hinge)</b> Special order item. NOT returnable.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Self-Closing Invisible Hinge, SOSS 218IC",
                "description": " The Self-Closing Invisible Hinge is the perfect solution to modern spaces where a clean look is desired. Once installed, this Invisible Spring Closer Hinge cannot be seen when the door is closed. A self-closing hinge, it works much like any spring hinge, it returns the door to the closed position by itself. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation. For use on on 1-3/4 inch thick wood doors, please use one hinge for every 75 lbs.\r\n",
